\newlabel{fig:alignment}{{3}{7}{Historical-alignment control on common audit targets. Filled markers use original history; open markers use column-permuted history. Small paired circles are split values; large diamonds are descriptive means across splits. Each value averages query checkpoints. Colors match Figure~\ref {fig:budget}. Permutation preserves column marginals and masks but changes joint structure and refits the complete predictor}{figure.caption.11}{}}
